  ADR-002 adaptive  one SwiftUI layer; adaptive grids (GridItem(.adaptive)) cover iPhone compact (2-up)
                    + iPad/macOS regular (3–4-up); NavigationStack/SplitView host via AppShell RouteHost.
  ADR-004 data      view holds no networking/business logic; binds @Observable LifetimeStatsPageModel over a
                    LifetimeStatsPageSource seam (KMP AnalyticsStore wiring is the P1/S8 dependency).
  ADR-005 material  glass via TSGlassPanel (.regularMaterial), never hand-rolled; design tokens only (P2).
  ADR-011 no-stub   every state + panel fully implemented; placeholder gate = 0.
  ADR-013 stale     LifetimeStatsPageModel.effectiveConnection downgrades to .stale past stalenessThreshold
                    (6h, matching web DataFreshnessAuto forceStaleAfterMs); LifetimeStalenessBanner + freshness chip.
  ADR-014 i18n      every visible literal via LifetimePageStrings → Localizable.xcstrings; 0 hardcoded.
  ADR-015 a11y      .accessibilityLabel/.isHeader on panels + tiles + badges; VoiceOver summaries
                    (LifetimeStatsPageAccessibility); Dynamic Type (TS font ramp + minimumScaleFactor);
                    light/dark/high-contrast via Tokens.swift; Reduce Motion honored on animations.
  SI units          read SI from API; convert ONLY at the display boundary (lifetimeFromKm/lifetimeFromKmh).

